        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong>The highly rated SRPG &quot;STRANGER SAGA,&quot; which ranked high on Japanese distribution sites, is finally coming to Steam!</strong><br><strong>Train ordinary citizens into elite warriors and overcome fierce tactical battles!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/5b5a7c2bbcb0a32d608ac684758389ed.avif?t=1780677955\" width=800 height=600 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;STRANGER SAGA&quot; is a turn-based SRPG where you lead a resistance army against a mighty enemy force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory lies with the &quot;Civilians&quot;—ordinary people with extraordinary potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilians start off weak but possess immense hidden abilities that unlock powerful combat skills as they grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to choose each Civilian's class path: Knight, Soldier, Scout, Barbarian, Archer, or Mage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate team of your own design!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong>A safe and beginner-friendly SRPG experience!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/b77dfed07ee62825e8afc9c1114d2b6a.avif?t=1780677955\" width=800 height=600 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reliable turn-by-turn saving system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units reduced to 0 HP in battle can return in the next stage without major penalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you are defeated, you can carry over earned experience points and money, allowing you to retry and grow stronger after each attempt—victory is always possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No penalties for the number of continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your total turn count will be recorded. If you love optimizing for minimum turns, try challenging yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*Note: There are no unlockable features based on total turn counts.*)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong>Jump into the action with an opening scene that ends in just 20 seconds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/48fc32b421e0b3f9fe1f718bb86af35e.avif?t=1780677955\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who want to dive into gameplay without long introductions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 chapters, 47 stages in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 unique allies to recruit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character gets an individual epilogue after the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expert Mode unlocks after clearing the main game!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Save Data Transfer Supported from Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/816a17154e54fe5984729e80f91c3d52.avif?t=1780677955\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo lets you play up to Stage 15!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you purchase the full version, you can continue with your save data from the demo.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong> How to Transfer Save Data</strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply copy the &quot;Save&quot; folder from the demo folder to the full version's game folder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong> About Gameplay Videos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share gameplay videos.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please refrain from using in-game assets or media on their own, such as playing only the BGM without gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Controls -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm …… Left Click / Enter / Z<br>Cancel …… Right Click / X<br>Quit Game …… Esc<br>Toggle Fullscreen Mode …… F4</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- In-Stage Controls -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Cursor …… Mouse / Arrow Keys<br>Open Menu …… Left Click / Enter / Z on empty tile<br>Move/Attack …… Left Click / Enter / Z on unit tile<br>Toggle Enemy Range …… Right Click / X<br>Fast Forward …… X</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong>For those having trouble with a small window size</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to change the scaling settings in Windows:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the Settings app:</strong><br>Click the <strong>Start menu</strong>, then click the <strong>Settings</strong> (gear icon).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select “System”:</strong><br>In the left-hand menu of the Settings window, click <strong>System</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select “Display”:</strong><br>In the System settings menu on the left, click <strong>Display</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust the scale:</strong><br>Under <strong>Scale and layout</strong>, find the option <strong>&quot;Change the size of text, apps, and other items&quot;</strong>, then use the slider or select a value from the dropdown menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Tool  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SRPG STUDIO</strong></p>",
